Package: tilawah
Version: 0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Tilawah <tilawah@example.invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10)
Recommends: mpv, yt-dlp, ffmpeg
Suggests: python3-pil
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: Terminal-native Qur'an audio player
 Stream and offline-play Qur'an audio from mp3quran.net, keep a personal
 YouTube shelf, sleep timer and ambient Islamic-geometric visuals -
 all in one terminal binary, no daemon required.
